  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nThe \"downloads\" permission is used by extensions to manage user's downloads but given that it is possible to set any filename for downloaded resources through it, you can use tricks from issues like https://crbug.com/chromium/848123 and https://crbug.com/chromium/788936"
